[I] Sangoma Media Transcode client and lib

[T] sngtc_client provides the client library and tools for Sangoma media
[T] transcoding (D-series) hardware, used by telephony software such as
[T] Asterisk and FreeSWITCH to offload voice codec transcoding.

[U] https://sangomakb.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MTC

[A] Sngtc_client Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

